<!DOCTYPE html
  PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">

<head>
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
</head>

<body
  style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(85, 85, 85); height: 100%; line-height: 1.4; margin: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; width: 100% !important;">

  <style>
    @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .inner-body {
        width: 100% !important;
      }

      .footer {
        width: 100% !important;
      }
    }

    @media only screen and (max-width: 500px) {
      .button {
        width: 100% !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
  <table class="wrapper" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
    style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: #f8f8f8; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%; -premailer-cellpadding: 0; -premailer-cellspacing: 0; -premailer-width: 100%;">
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td align="center"
          style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box;">
          <table class="content" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
            style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%; -premailer-cellpadding: 0; -premailer-cellspacing: 0; -premailer-width: 100%;">
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td class="header"
                  style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 25px 0; text-align: center;">
                  <a target="_blank" href="https://delinternet.com/"
                    style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; color: #b9d205; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 300; text-decoration: none; text-shadow: 0 1px 0 white;">
                    <%- include('../partials/delinternetLogo.ejs') %>
                  </a>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <!-- Email Body -->
              <tr>
                <td class="body" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                  style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: #FFFFFF; border-bottom: 1px solid #e7e7e7; border-top: 1px solid #e7e7e7; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%; -premailer-cellpadding: 0; -premailer-cellspacing: 0; -premailer-width: 100%;">
                  <table class="inner-body" align="center" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                    style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0; width: 600px; -premailer-cellpadding: 0; -premailer-cellspacing: 0; -premailer-width: 600px;">
                    <!-- Body content -->
                    <tbody>
                      <tr>
                        <td class="content-cell"
                          style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 35px;">
                          <h1
                            style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 300; margin-top: 0; text-align: left;">
                            Hola <%= clientName %>!</h1>
                          <p
                            style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4em; margin-top: 0; text-align: left;">
                            Ja tens disponible la factura corresponent als teus serveis contractats.</p>
                          <p
                            style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4em; margin-top: 0; text-align: left;">
                            A continuació t'indiquem l'import total de la teva factura corresponent a l'últim període de
                            facturació, d'un import de: <strong
                              style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4em; margin-top: 0; text-align: left;">
                              <%= total %>
                                €
                            </strong></p>
                          <table class="action" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                            style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 30px auto; padding: 0; text-align: center; width: 100%; -premailer-cellpadding: 0; -premailer-cellspacing: 0; -premailer-width: 100%;">
                            <tbody>
                              <tr>
                                <td align="center"
                                  style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box;">
                                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                                    style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box;">
                                    <tbody>
                                      <tr>
                                        <td align="center"
                                          style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box;">
                                          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                                            style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box;">
                                            <tbody>
                                              <tr>
                                                <td
                                                  style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box;">
                                                  <a target="_blank" href="<%= link %>" class="button button-primary"
                                                    style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; padding-top: 6px; padding-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 12px; padding-right: 12px; color: #FFF; display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; -webkit-text-size-adjust: none; font-weight: 300; background-color: #b9d205; border-top: 1px solid #b9d205; border-right: 1px solid #b9d205; border-bottom: 1px solid #b9d205; border-left: 1px solid #b9d205;">Descarregar
                                                    la meva factura</a>
                                                </td>
                                              </tr>
                                            </tbody>
                                          </table>
                                        </td>
                                      </tr>
                                    </tbody>
                                  </table>
                                </td>
                              </tr>
                            </tbody>
                          </table>
                          <p
                            style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4em; margin-top: 0; text-align: left;">
                            D&rsquo;altra banda, registra&rsquo;t a la teva &agrave;rea privada
                            <u><b>my.delinternet.com</b></u>, i podr&agrave;s
                            consultar en tot moment les teves factures i consums mensuals.
                          </p>





                          <table class="action" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                            style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 30px auto; padding: 0; text-align: center; width: 100%; -premailer-cellpadding: 0; -premailer-cellspacing: 0; -premailer-width: 100%;">
                            <tbody>
                              <tr>
                                <td align="center"
                                  style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box;">
                                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                                    style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box;">
                                    <tbody>
                                      <tr>
                                        <td align="center"
                                          style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box;">
                                          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                                            style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box;">
                                            <tbody>
                                              <tr>
                                                <td
                                                  style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box;">
                                                  <a data-id="button1" data-description="url" data-type="link"
                                                    data-editsize="half" target="_blank"
                                                    href="https://my.delinternet.com/" class="button button-primary"
                                                    style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; padding-top: 6px; padding-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 12px; padding-right: 12px; color: #FFF; display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; -webkit-text-size-adjust: none; font-weight: 300; background-color: #b9d205; border-top: 1px solid #b9d205; border-right: 1px solid #b9d205; border-bottom: 1px solid #b9d205; border-left: 1px solid #b9d205;">
                                                    <span data-editsize="half" data-id="text" data-description="Text"
                                                      data-type="text">Area usuari MyDelinternet</span>
                                                  </a>
                                                </td>
                                              </tr>
                                            </tbody>
                                          </table>
                                        </td>
                                      </tr>
                                    </tbody>
                                  </table>
                                </td>
                              </tr>
                            </tbody>
                          </table>




                          <!-- Salutation -->

                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </tbody>
                  </table>
                </td>
              </tr>

              <tr>
                <td
                  style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box;">
                  <table class="footer" align="center" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                    style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0; text-align: center; width: 600px; -premailer-cellpadding: 0; -premailer-cellspacing: 0; -premailer-width: 600px;">
                    <tbody>
                      <tr>
                        <td class="content-cell" align="center"
                          style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 35px;">
                          <p
                            style="font-family: 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.4em; margin-top: 0; color: #aaa; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;">
                            (c) 2018 Delinternet. Tots els drets reservats.<br><a style="color:#888;"
                              href="mailto:facturacio@delinternet.com">facturacio@delinternet.com</a> T <a
                              style="color:#888;" href="tel:877990500">877990500</a>
                          </p>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </tbody>
                  </table>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</body>

</html>